cqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"KEYNOTE-189和KEYNOTE-407研究共同证实了帕博利珠单抗联合化疗一线治疗晚期NSCLC的优势，其最重要的临床意义在于"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"显著提高了疗效，且生存获益与PD-L1表达水平无关","correct":true,"option_id":"47f3bedc-8905-45e8-909c-2e037209cc38"},{"type":"text","content":"避免了所有化疗相关的不良反应","correct":false,"option_id":"43802b72-17d9-426c-aecb-a283f9651b02"},{"type":"text","content":"仅对肺鳞癌患者有效","correct":false,"option_id":"0aa62ecc-59f9-4e2d-9293-02987846c4aa"},{"type":"text","content":"完全取代了免疫单药治疗的地位","correct":false,"option_id":"53676b0a-e780-439e-bb8f-e4e5efb6a7e0"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"KEYNOTE-189和407分别研究非鳞状及鳞状转移性NSCLC。不同PD-L1表达层级均观察到联合化疗的获益, 包括低表达或阴性人群; 这不代表各层级获益幅度完全相同。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/fda71ff1-160c-45e2-ba87-dc14d8379d80/f419d01d4cb8e5b4aa3a04346d7ff5bbdbc36f88c0d673e83c1354b8f4e1b242.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"fda71ff1-160c-45e2-ba87-dc14d8379d80","revision":"sha256:f419d01d4cb8e5b4aa3a04346d7ff5bbdbc36f88c0d673e83c1354b8f4e1b242","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"关于流感患者的传染性不正确的是"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"流感患者一般持续排毒3-7天","correct":false,"option_id":"c482a1f6-7875-4173-b06b-e844cb8db2eb"},{"type":"text","content":"隐性流感患者不是流感的主要传染源，有发热症状的流感患者才有传染性","correct":true,"option_id":"05278ff4-c66f-43da-91d1-3a20f37a6f80"},{"type":"text","content":"儿童、免疫功能受损及危重症流感患者排毒时间可超过1周","correct":false,"option_id":"b137f6a5-7698-4def-96c2-c87100cbc0fd"},{"type":"text","content":"流感从潜伏期末到急性期都有传染性","correct":false,"option_id":"482b25a7-d7be-4281-8751-3a27aa4f0eb6"}]}}},{"path":"versions/624c8780-c1b7-44b7-888e-b9b2f42fffa6/2593dfa1133560cfe696b9cde8146556e3dd0272724dfc153bb53a92751cfd8b.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"624c8780-c1b7-44b7-888e-b9b2f42fffa6","revision":"sha256:2593dfa1133560cfe696b9cde8146556e3dd0272724dfc153bb53a92751cfd8b","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"哮喘长期管理的目标不包括"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"维持肺功能尽可能接近正常","correct":false,"option_id":"524c12cd-3cb6-4c6c-9188-2be0efd1b629"},{"type":"text","content":"达到并维持症状的控制","correct":false,"option_id":"60dbec41-e0cd-4f5d-9d7f-0f8a18afb844"},{"type":"text","content":"长期依赖SABA来维持日常状态","correct":true,"option_id":"fabc2b32-2c86-45f7-80f1-833984e73674"},{"type":"text","content":"维持正常活动水平，包括运动能力","correct":false,"option_id":"d04ea1b4-5330-47dc-a5ce-335a0b9e6449"},{"type":"text","content":"预防哮喘急性发作","correct":false,"option_id":"44c2dc55-3edb-4422-b16c-076e9008d2af"}]}}},{"path":"versions/17b8117e-f1ec-42c7-85f5-86614820a285/48064bb505e7f96a552749b4fc2dbd487b4bf63b734e6bca4d2551c8b4521eea.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"17b8117e-f1ec-42c7-85f5-86614820a285","revision":"sha256:48064bb505e7f96a552749b4fc2dbd487b4bf63b734e6bca4d2551c8b4521eea","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"社区获得性肺炎初始治疗病情评价错误的是"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"应在初始治疗后72小时对病情进行评价","correct":false,"option_id":"b0f43f84-ab03-4753-a705-e28aebe38c92"},{"type":"text","content":"临床表现72小时内进展恶化，需重新评估患者的诊断及药物使用情况","correct":false,"option_id":"5cd1c7b4-7318-483f-8958-572b4057cd8d"},{"type":"text","content":"只要临床表现72小时内无恶化，可继续观察，不必急于更换抗感染药物","correct":false,"option_id":"168144ea-559e-4d3b-9563-485c99ce52dd"},{"type":"text","content":"CAP患者影像学改善滞后于临床症状","correct":false,"option_id":"9ab15270-7052-4fba-9ebb-958cbc57eba0"},{"type":"text","content":"CAP患者在初始治疗后24-48小时观察临床症状是否改善","correct":true,"option_id":"be1ece09-7741-4516-b190-47ab9b0799fe"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"学在浙大给出答案为E。课程课件指出应在初始治疗后72小时内评估, 多数患者72小时内症状改善, 影像改善常滞后。24-48小时观察症状本身并非不合理, 因此E作为“错误”选项存在争议。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/a763d967-c22f-487d-b36c-d38331349fd8/dc58a55c1156b057b8f19d9adcb205d105ab7ec3d17e98708e365fad93068652.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"a763d967-c22f-487d-b36c-d38331349fd8","revision":"sha256:dc58a55c1156b057b8f19d9adcb205d105ab7ec3d17e98708e365fad93068652","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"肺栓塞最常见类型是"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"脂肪栓塞","correct":false,"option_id":"bf10382e-6229-43d8-98a9-b501310f4555"},{"type":"text","content":"血栓栓塞","correct":true,"option_id":"12426976-ac4c-468b-b995-cc14a9eccce7"},{"type":"text","content":"瘤栓栓塞","correct":false,"option_id":"59635274-3a3d-4176-8902-cbe418f9877b"},{"type":"text","content":"羊水栓塞","correct":false,"option_id":"1a6e7cd9-34c8-44e8-a2da-c293d563a1c9"},{"type":"text","content":"空气栓塞","correct":false,"option_id":"3eec88fe-1ab6-4588-b2df-4521d7024195"}]}}},{"path":"versions/5f3cd07e-ea74-4821-be86-192c6a6f4f62/92fe19cee052447b4547d60ea2310f71c3612cfdcb0b44b14a4d3f2dc10dc697.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"5f3cd07e-ea74-4821-be86-192c6a6f4f62","revision":"sha256:92fe19cee052447b4547d60ea2310f71c3612cfdcb0b44b14a4d3f2dc10dc697","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"根据IPASS等关键研究，目前对晚期非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者使用EGFR-TKI进行一线靶向治疗的首要前提是"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"患者对常规化疗不耐受或拒绝化疗","correct":false,"option_id":"49abba73-a038-4c00-bd3e-a903f42b6e96"},{"type":"text","content":"患者为亚裔、不吸烟的腺癌患者","correct":false,"option_id":"859f45e8-8b69-4f08-a35c-f3890986c77c"},{"type":"text","content":"患者既往接受过至少一种化疗方案后疾病进展","correct":false,"option_id":"5a9f034d-a385-4fd0-94be-50311f24a90b"},{"type":"text","content":"肿瘤组织标本经检测确认存在EGFR敏感突变","correct":true,"option_id":"a274e028-b626-474f-93d5-1fe3f3c43b4a"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"EGFR-TKI一线治疗的关键是确认存在相应的EGFR敏感突变, 不能仅凭族裔或吸烟史选择。组织检测是常用方式, 合适时也可用经验证的血浆ctDNA检测; 血浆阴性时应在可行情况下补做组织检测。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/63724609-7bb5-4179-a853-ac570f214d34/f9e075f0a36068d2102ad2296c6d8f940e48813345021fb9c5e2475d487869a3.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"156abb32-94a1-4b00-b28b-b29d01372829","question_id":"63724609-7bb5-4179-a853-ac570f214d34","revision":"sha256:f9e075f0a36068d2102ad2296c6d8f940e48813345021fb9c5e2475d487869a3","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"对于接受一代或二代EGFR-TKI治疗后出现疾病进展的患者，下列哪项是后续治疗前需要明确的关键耐药机制？"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"KRAS G12C突变","correct":false,"option_id":"b04d320e-4c98-4fcd-853d-17785f3d77be"},{"type":"text","content":"EGFR T790M突变","correct":true,"option_id":"0c67a149-5478-411c-b8f7-3e75bb76f82e"},{"type":"text","content":"EGFR 20外显子插入突变","correct":false,"option_id":"6eeb97a9-7ba3-4521-a209-605c4d4847b8"},{"type":"text","content":"ALK基因融合","correct":false,"option_id":"2b39407f-98b9-419e-b7ec-acc73519f6cd"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"T790M是一代或二代EGFR-TKI治疗后常见的获得性耐药机制, 检测有助于选择后续治疗; 但并非所有患者进展都由这一突变引起。"}]}}}]}